LLC. Apache-2.0 grants no trademark rights (Section 6). Use is governed by the
Sign in with Google Branding Guidelines:
https://developers.google.com/identity/branding-guidelines

Requirements honored by this app: the "G" is displayed full color (never
monochrome), on a white background, unmodified, and the Google sign-in control
is presented at least as prominently as the other sign-in option.

